<title>USA: Flint Hosp Bldg Auth, Mich.</title>
<headline>Flint Hosp Bldg Auth, Mich.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Inc., said it priced $14 million Flint Hospital Building Authority, Mich., weekly variable rate building authority revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997 A, with an initial rate of 5.50 percent in 2006.</p>
</text>
